    speaker: Ate Grace (pharmacist)
    playerLine: Medicine for a fever, please. The generic one.
    npcLines:
    - One dose a day until the fever is gone. Don't stop early, even if they feel better.
    - Generic works the same, it's just cheaper. One dose lasts a day.
  - id: buy_cure
    name: Instant cure (branded)
    description: The expensive branded treatment. Cures any illness at once, for anyone in the family. Kept in the cabinet until you use it.
